 *   - Read/exfiltrate env vars and secrets  (process.env)
 *   - Execute shell commands               (require('child_process').execSync(...))
 *   - Crash the server                     (process.exit() / infinite loops)
 *   - Read or write the filesystem         (require('fs').readFileSync(...))
 *
 * This is a Remote Code Execution (RCE) vulnerability.
 *
 * SAFE ALTERNATIVE — vm.runInNewContext:
 * --------------------------------------
