 * zero-dependency recursive-descent parser, then *walk* that AST with
 * a controlled evaluator.  Only the following are permitted:
 *
 *   Literals      : numbers, strings, booleans, null
 *   Identifiers   : names that exist on the caller-supplied `ctx` object
 *   Member access : ctx.foo.bar   (dot notation only)
 *   Unary ops     : !  -  +
 *   Binary ops    : ==  !=  ===  !==  <  <=  >  >=  &&  ||  +  -  *  /  %
